{"id":"00403","root":"uni00403_1","name":{"ja":"蠱人間","en":"Enthralling Human"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"蠱人間","en":"Enthralling Human"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":null,"limited":false,"characterId":249,"profile":{"ja":"異界霊を召喚するための蠱毒の儀式で犠牲になった人間たち。閉鎖された館の中で、儀式の日が永遠に繰り返されているため、何度も蘇っては互いに殺し合いを続けている。その影響で色々な蟲と人間とが混ざり合ったような異形の身体になっている。すでに二本の足で立つことができず、元の手足と腹から生えた新たな足で床を這うようにして歩く。","en":"They are humans who were sacrificed in the Enthralling Poison ritual to summon the Unnamed Otherworldly Spirit. Trapped in a closed mansion, they're forced to relive the day of the ritual forever, repeatedly killing each other. This has twisted their bodies into grotesque forms, merging them with various insects. They can no longer stand on two legs and now crawl on the floor using their original limbs and the new ones that have grown from their abdomens."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":null,"forms":[{"id":"uni00403_1","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","levelMax":40,"stats":{"hp":[648,1293],"sp":[100,100],"atk":[72,148],"def":[66,135],"spd":[64,64],"luck":[0,0]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["2","850001"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage"}]},"850001":{"slot":"skill1","id":850001,"name":{"ja":"噛み千切り"},"hits":5,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 175% Devilish damage"},{"text":"1 enemy: 25% ch